Many classes under target_teavm_263/src/main/java and target_teavm_263/vendor/lwjgl carry the
package and class names of libraries the game links against (Netty, Log4j, SLF4J, LWJGL, OSHI,
ICU4J, JNA, lz4-java, Commons Compress, and Mojang's authlib, jtracy, logging and text2speech).
They are small browser stand-ins written for this port that keep only the names and signatures
the game needs, unless a file carries an upstream notice.


